e clean. Evidence /private/var/folders/2x/wylr59t17ds36l1l7ng25y7w0000gn/T/artroom-checker-stage2-mutants-yxvw8t2p/{run-controls.py,replacement-inventory.json,results.json} and per-control logs/JSON. Initial non-compiling edits and the initial non-assertion cache error are excluded. This is eight controls, not independent proof of all 82 guards/136 builder mutations or grant delegability.\n\nOpen acceptance remains explicit. Seven whole declared-run test bodies are deferred to the separately owned stage-3 log/replay work: carry replay, bounded publication, large transfer/chunking, first publications, full-session decision replay, and production log remote/hash/token cleanup. Their additional publication/batching/adapter assertions are not declared-path coverage here, though legacy passes. Condition 5's original live measure/rows.mjs/provider dataset/all-object billing baseline remains owed; the 13 local Room SQL success cases are useful parity controls but omit check, other Durable Objects, provider/background attribution and original harness cases. Planner's 1d4ec054 confirms no waiver. Do not close full fd6f00b6 with those conditions replaced by local-only evidence.\n\nArchitecture: the shared vocabulary, historical kind/binding and stored numeric lease are sound directions, and stage ownership keeps log/producer work separate. Approval remains blocked by the concrete boundary defects and unclosed acceptance. Security: fail at current delegation/invitation boundaries and recovery dispatch as above. Simplification: pass in direction; retain a single vocabulary source, own-field validation and clear platform adapters, without weakening historical receipts, introducing new approval gates or narrowing the complete scope.\n\nA replacement needs current artifacts for every changed path on one exact bound head, fresh root gates, these six regressions green with their paired controls, compiling named controls for the repair guards, truthful deferred/live evidence and a guarded independent review. No source, deploy or live-provider write was performed by checker.","body":{"artifact":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:68288ecbf8fc6a26192cea6e042c38712a2ba651","binding":"assigned","head":"d2704473a126932f70240f20870a265fb2180dfd","head_news_acknowledged":"[\"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:fd4d7a027ce558746b127e6fdace8a8698b90936\",\"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:1d4ec05492742fe6429a1b90ccd8eb42f179ba65\"]","implementations":"[\"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:c96e88fc3ce2d8b910de4c38d66c9030a0a8b8c7\"]","review_frontier":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:0385a26c30e2080f3a4f4d661d0d6af603cf39bd","review_path":"reviewguard@1","verdict":"changes-requested"}}